From: rossini at blindglobe.net (A.J. Rossini)
Date: Wed Oct  8 16:04:38 2003
Subject: [BioC] Affy: Present calls in an eset
In-Reply-To: <C80ECAFA2ACC1B45BE45D133ED660ADE410B0E@crbsmxsusr04.pharma.aventis.com>
